    {
      "expression": "the main draw",
      "meaning_zh": "主要的吸引力",
      "why_useful": "谈论偏好、选择地点或事物时，比 the main reason 更自然、更有口语感。",
      "example": "For me, the main draw of living abroad is the freedom to start over.",
      "usage_note": "draw 在这里是名词，常搭配 the main/biggest draw is..."
    },
    {
