      "example": "The thing that gets me about online shopping is all the packaging.",
      "usage_note": "后接名词或动名词，语气偏口语。"
    },
    {
      "expression": "eat up",
      "meaning_zh": "消耗掉（时间、金钱等）",
      "why_useful": "描述时间被大量占用的生动动词短语，比 spend 更有画面感。",
